# Staff Cluster, i18n, About & Contact Pages Implementation

## Goal
Implement new features for the Ibraheem Mahsob barbershop website:
1. Replace the current "About Section" image placeholder with a 4-card staff cluster
2. Create About page with staff grid and place photos
3. Create Contact page with map and info cards
4. Add AR/EN language toggle across all pages

## Proposed Changes

### New Files

#### [NEW] [additions.css](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/css/additions.css)
CSS-only file loaded LAST to avoid collisions. Contains:
- `.staff-cluster`, `.staff-feature`, `.staff-row`, `.staff-card` - Home page staff cluster
- `.about-staff-grid`, `.profile-card` - About page staff grid
- `.place-photos-grid`, `.photo-slot` - About page photo placeholders
- `.contact-grid`, `.map-frame`, `.info-card` - Contact page layout
- `.lang-toggle` - Language toggle button styling

---

#### [NEW] [i18n.js](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/js/i18n.js)
JavaScript i18n system:
- `translations` object with [en](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/admin/admin.js#39-43) and [ar](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/booking.html#412-418) keys
- `applyLang(lang)` function updates `html[lang]`, `html[dir]`, `body.rtl` class
- Persists choice to `localStorage("site_lang")`
- Wires `#langToggle` button click event
- Default language: Arabic ([ar](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/booking.html#412-418))

---

#### [NEW] [about.html](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/about.html)
New About page:
- Copies header/nav/footer from [index.html](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/index.html)
- Intro section
- Staff grid (7 people: Ibrahim + 4 barbers + cashier + helper)
- Place photos grid (6 placeholder slots)
- Includes `additions.css` and `i18n.js`

---

#### [NEW] [contactus.html](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/contactus.html)
New Contact page:
- Copies header/nav/footer from [index.html](file:///d:/Work/ibraheem-mahsob/index.html)
- Map iframe placeholder (left on desktop)
- Info cards: address, phone, working hours (right on desktop)
- Mobile: map first, then info cards stacked
- Includes `additions.css` and `i18n.js`

---

