## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing Checklist
- [ ] **Desktop (1200+)**: Staff cluster shows Ibrahim wide card above, 3 barbers in row below
- [ ] **Tablet (768-991)**: Layout stays symmetric, cards resize gracefully
- [ ] **Mobile (360-430)**: Ibrahim first, then 3 barbers stacked vertically
- [ ] **Language Toggle**: Click toggles AR/EN, updates text, flips `dir` attribute
- [ ] **Persistence**: Refresh page, language choice persists from localStorage
- [ ] **Hover Effects**: New cards have subtle lift effect, existing cards unchanged
- [ ] **About Page**: Staff grid shows 7 cards, responsive at all breakpoints
- [ ] **Contact Page**: Map left + info right on desktop, stacked on mobile
